{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><blockquote><p>中銀香港由即日起至11月30日，推出全新「Digital One智勝一籌大抽獎」，客戶只需於推廣期間於中銀香港手機銀行「智惠賞」登記參加，並完成不同主題之指定數碼理財任務，即有機會瓜分總值1,000萬信用卡積分！</p></blockquote><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"579\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/76e8cebed4d54e9130cae9434c6be368ac094d6add6e91a82c53227d7941d160/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fpc3mag.com%2Fec5940e2b798588edb6d070890e7fd20.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>「Digital One智勝一籌」星級大使陳蕾早前於宣傳影片拍攝中分享，她平日工作繁忙，因此特別重視方便快捷的數碼理財體驗，能節省更多時間投入創作及工作。今次「Digital One智勝一籌大抽獎」正好鼓勵客戶體驗各項數碼理財服務，實踐數碼理財新方式。</p><p></p><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"755\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b5b57f249c8a988fcf8f0a1fb584718f7281707c3a32e5f06d830a4dc20b6e34/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fpc3mag.com%2F0307f9f28f809043971a1f7b40e362a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p><strong>活動詳情請參閱「Digital One智勝一籌」推廣網站：</strong><a href=\"https://www.bochk.com/dam/more/digitalone/tc.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>https://www.bochk.com/dam/more/digitalone/tc.html</strong></a></p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><p><strong>*積分兌換率為每15積分相等於1「亞洲萬里通」里數。以上來回機票兌換參考2026年10月22日亞洲萬里通之兌換率，並以亞洲萬里通最新公佈資訊為準。</strong></p><p>這篇文章 <a href=\"https://pc3mag.com/bochk-digital-one/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中銀香港「DIGITAL ONE智勝一籌」大抽獎</a> 最早出現於 <a href=\"https://pc3mag.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PC3 Magazine</a>。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:22:07.208420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":438,"images":2,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:02:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:42.764682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:18:38.568078+00:00","content_hash":"420a6f8c9303bb008e0d8f27e81d70844f0c5db9ed2e5b4c1355560ea35a46a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}